SceneOrchestra includes a vendored LLaMAFactory training core derived from
LLaMA-Factory (https://github.com/hiyouga/LLaMA-Factory), licensed under the
Apache License 2.0. The upstream base snapshot is commit
03a70ba8ddb9636b90627753d49a4a9a054585bd, plus the SceneOrchestra-specific
best-trajectory-index evaluation metric in the SFT workflow.

The SceneWeaver codebase and assets are not redistributed; users install the
official SceneWeaver repository separately.
